  "title": "Zesty Creamy Irish Shirataki Stew",
  "description": "A savory and creamy Irish dish featuring shirataki noodles, shio-koji cure, and vegan-friendly ingredients, all cooked in a traditional cataplana vessel. This stew is perfect for a festive and comforting meal.",
